    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Aftercare videos · 0–2y\",\"title\":\"Babies and Toddlers (0-2 years old)\",\"lede\":\"Below are a few videos which we would like you to watch. They include a consultation explaining what to expect on the day of circumcision, aftercare video for the Plastibell/ Circumplast (ring) method, how to change the nappy and an explanation of how to clean the penis after the ring comes off. Please note that every patient is different and whilst this explanation will apply to most of patients, if there is anything different which your son may need, we will advise you accordingly. For example, we sometimes use the Forceps Guided (traditional) method instead of the ring and we have included the aftercare for this method on this page as well.\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Aftercare\",\"href\":\"/aftercare/\"},{\"label\":\"0–2y\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We are adding this information in other languages by clicking the links below. Please note that these translations has been done with AI software and we cannot guarantee the accuracy of the translations, so please also refer to these main English videos.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/arabic-babies-toddlers-circumcision-videos/\" hreflang=\"ar\">Arabic - عربي</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/turkish-babies-toddlers-circumcision-videos/\" hreflang=\"tr\">Turkish - Türkçe</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><a href=\"/farsi-babies-toddlers-circumcision-videos/\" hreflang=\"fa\">Farsi - فارسی</a></li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"bg-navy\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"aftercare-sheets\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm bg-navy\" id=\"aftercare-sheets\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Aftercare sheets\",\"heading\":\"Download our aftercare instructions sheet\",\"lede\":\"You will be given this aftercare sheet after the circumcision but you can also download it by clicking on the link below:\",\"display\":\"d-3\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/file-link {\"text\":\"Ring method aftercare instructions sheet\",\"mediaKey\":\"aftercare/documents/ring-method-aftercare-sheet.pdf\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/file-link {\"text\":\"Forceps Guided (traditional) method aftercare instructions sheet - Only use this if we have advised you\",\"mediaKey\":\"aftercare/documents/forceps-guided-children-aftercare-sheet.pdf\"} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"videos\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"videos\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Aftercare videos · 0–2y\",\"heading\":\"Videos for babies and toddlers\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/video-grid {\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Preparation for circumcision\",\"description\":\"\",\"duration\":\"1:46\",\"mediaKey\":\"aftercare/videos/preparation-0-2.mp4\",\"poster\":\"/wp-content/themes/circumcision-london/assets/images/aftercare/posters/preparation-0-2.jpg\",\"mp4\":\"\",\"posterId\":0,\"mp4Id\":0}],\"layout\":\"list\",\"itemLevel\":3,\"showHead\":false} /--><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"cil-aftercare-checklist\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large cil-aftercare-checklist\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/circumcision-london/assets/images/aftercare/checklist-0-2.jpg\" alt=\"Circumcision Checklist 0-2 years old: Fill out the consent form sent you by email. Bring IDs for your son, mother and father. Tight nappies. Baby wipes. Pacifier/ dummy - even if he does not take one, please buy one for the circumcision. Bottle of milk - if your son takes one. Vaseline - 250ml.\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Circumcision checklist, 0-2 years old</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:cil/video-grid {\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Consultation\",\"description\":\"\",\"duration\":\"3:09\",\"mediaKey\":\"aftercare/videos/consultation-0-2.mp4\",\"poster\":\"/wp-content/themes/circumcision-london/assets/images/aftercare/posters/consultation-0-2.jpg\",\"mp4\":\"\",\"posterId\":0,\"mp4Id\":0},{\"title\":\"Plastibell/ Circumplast (ring) method aftercare instructions\",\"description\":\"\",\"duration\":\"4:54\",\"mediaKey\":\"aftercare/videos/ring-method-aftercare.mp4\",\"poster\":\"/wp-content/themes/circumcision-london/assets/images/aftercare/posters/ring-method-aftercare.jpg\",\"mp4\":\"\",\"posterId\":0,\"mp4Id\":0},{\"title\":\"How to apply Vaseline to the nappy (real patient example).\",\"description\":\"Apply the nappy tightly\",\"duration\":\"0:49\",\"mediaKey\":\"aftercare/videos/vaseline-nappy-patient.mp4\",\"poster\":\"/wp-content/themes/circumcision-london/assets/images/aftercare/posters/vaseline-nappy-patient.jpg\",\"mp4\":\"\",\"posterId\":0,\"mp4Id\":0},{\"title\":\"How to apply Vaseline to the nappy (mannequin example).\",\"description\":\"Apply the nappy tightly\",\"duration\":\"2:26\",\"mediaKey\":\"aftercare/videos/vaseline-nappy-mannequin.mp4\",\"poster\":\"/wp-content/themes/circumcision-london/assets/images/aftercare/posters/vaseline-nappy-mannequin.jpg\",\"mp4\":\"\",\"posterId\":0,\"mp4Id\":0},{\"title\":\"How to burp the baby.\",\"description\":\"Please do this on a flat surface, not your legs (your legs can press on the penis).\",\"duration\":\"0:17\",\"mediaKey\":\"aftercare/videos/burp-baby.mp4\",\"poster\":\"/wp-content/themes/circumcision-london/assets/images/aftercare/posters/burp-baby.jpg\",\"mp4\":\"\",\"posterId\":0,\"mp4Id\":0},{\"title\":\"How to clean the penis after the ring comes off (buried penis and normal penis)\",\"description\":\"\",\"duration\":\"0:54\",\"mediaKey\":\"aftercare/videos/clean-penis.mp4\",\"poster\":\"/wp-content/themes/circumcision-london/assets/images/aftercare/posters/clean-penis.jpg\",\"mp4\":\"\",\"posterId\":0,\"mp4Id\":0},{\"title\":\"How to separate skin adhesions if they occur\",\"description\":\"\",\"duration\":\"0:58\",\"mediaKey\":\"aftercare/videos/skin-adhesions.mp4\",\"poster\":\"/wp-content/themes/circumcision-london/assets/images/aftercare/posters/skin-adhesions.jpg\",\"mp4\":\"\",\"posterId\":0,\"mp4Id\":0},{\"title\":\"How to stop post-operative bleeding following Plastibell/ Circumplast (ring) circumcision.\",\"description\":\"Only for Doctors to watch and attempt\",\"duration\":\"4:31\",\"mediaKey\":\"aftercare/videos/ring-bleeding-doctors.mp4\",\"poster\":\"/wp-content/themes/circumcision-london/assets/images/aftercare/posters/ring-bleeding-doctors.jpg\",\"mp4\":\"\",\"posterId\":0,\"mp4Id\":0},{\"title\":\"How to cut the ring off if it does not come off within 14 days.\",\"description\":\"This should be done at our clinic. However, if you live far and cannot attend, show this to the doctors in A\\u0026amp;E who should be able to cut the ring off. \\u003cstrong\\u003eDO NOT attempt this at home.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\",\"duration\":\"0:49\",\"mediaKey\":\"aftercare/videos/cut-ring-off.mp4\",\"poster\":\"/wp-content/themes/circumcision-london/assets/images/aftercare/posters/cut-ring-off.jpg\",\"mp4\":\"\",\"posterId\":0,\"mp4Id\":0}],\"layout\":\"list\",\"itemLevel\":3,\"showHead\":false} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-navy\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"forceps-guided-method\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-navy\" id=\"forceps-guided-method\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Forceps guided (traditional) method\",\"heading\":\"If we have told you we used the forceps guided method\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The videos below relate to the forceps guided (traditional) method. Only watch these videos if you have been told this is the method we have used for your son.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Some of the above videos on how to change the nappy and burp your son apply to both methods.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>You can download the aftercare sheet for this method by clicking below.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/file-link {\"text\":\"Forceps guided (traditional) method - children - aftercare sheet\",\"mediaKey\":\"aftercare/documents/forceps-guided-children-aftercare-sheet.pdf\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/video-grid {\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Forceps guided (traditional) method aftercare instructions.\",\"description\":\"This is not the common method for this age. Please only watch this if you have been told by us.\",\"duration\":\"3:22\",\"mediaKey\":\"aftercare/videos/forceps-aftercare-children.mp4\",\"poster\":\"/wp-content/themes/circumcision-london/assets/images/aftercare/posters/forceps-aftercare-children.jpg\",\"mp4\":\"\",\"posterId\":0,\"mp4Id\":0},{\"title\":\"How to stop bleeding with Forceps guided (traditional) method.\",\"description\":\"This is not the common method for this age. Please only watch this if you have been told by us.\",\"duration\":\"0:52\",\"mediaKey\":\"aftercare/videos/forceps-bleeding-0-2.mp4\",\"poster\":\"/wp-content/themes/circumcision-london/assets/images/aftercare/posters/forceps-bleeding-0-2.jpg\",\"mp4\":\"\",\"posterId\":0,\"mp4Id\":0}],\"layout\":\"list\",\"itemLevel\":3,\"showHead\":false} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-warm\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-warm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Aftercare\",\"heading\":\"Videos for other age groups\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/group-cards {\"level\":3,\"banded\":false,\"items\":[{\"href\":\"/babies-toddlers-circumcision-videos/\",\"age\":\"Babies and toddlers\",\"title\":\"0–2y\",\"price\":\"12 videos\",\"blurb\":\"Preparation, consultation, ring method aftercare, applying Vaseline to the nappy, burping, cleaning and the aftercare sheets.\",\"cta\":\"Watch the 0–2y videos\"},{\"href\":\"/children-circumcision-videos/\",\"age\":\"Children\",\"title\":\"3–13y\",\"price\":\"8 videos\",\"blurb\":\"Preparation, consultation, forceps guided aftercare, applying Vaseline with underwear, cleaning and the aftercare sheet.\",\"cta\":\"Watch the 3–13y videos\"},{\"href\":\"/adult-circumcision-videos/\",\"age\":\"Teenagers and adults\",\"title\":\"14+ yrs and adults\",\"price\":\"5 videos\",\"blurb\":\"Preparation, consultation, forceps guided aftercare, applying Vaseline with underwear and the aftercare sheet.\",\"cta\":\"Watch the 14+ yrs and adults videos\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band {\"title\":\"Already had the procedure and something is worrying you?\",\"text\":\"Call the clinic. Follow-up appointments during the healing period are included where needed.\",\"eyebrow\":\"Talk to us\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Book a consultation\",\"ctaUrl\":\"/book/\",\"phoneLabel\":\"Call 020 8951 3794\",\"phoneUrl\":\"tel:+442089513794\",\"cardTitle\":\"Would you rather write than speak?\",\"cardHtml\":\"\\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:10px\\u0022\\u003eA phone call asks you to be fluent and composed in the moment. \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://wa.me/447886779958\\u0022 rel=\\u0022noopener\\u0022 target=\\u0022_blank\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022whatsapp-cta\\u0022 style=\\u0022color:var(\\u002d\\u002dblue-deep)\\u0022\\u003eWhatsApp\\u003c/a\\u003e does not. You can take your time, translate, and forward the answer to whoever else in the family needs to see it.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:12px\\u0022\\u003eWe reply during opening hours, and we are used to the questions people feel awkward asking out loud.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->"
